{"id":167223282084072,"type":"artist","name":"Stars Of The Lid","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":11,"info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Adam_Wiltzie.png?width=500","bio":"Stars Of The Lid son un dúo de Austin (Texas), formado por Adam Wiltzie y Brian McBride, que bien podría considerarse único en su género, el de la música. O, al menos, en su naturaleza: esa que desde mediados de los noventa -debutaron con ‘Music For Nitrous Oxide’ (Sedimental, 95)- les lleva a crear contextos sonoros de carácter minimalista, efímero y atmosférico. También pausados, propiedad esta que se extrapola a su producción discográfica de un tiempo a esta parte. Concretamente, a partir del cambio de siglo.","tags":["ambient","drone","electronic","post-rock","instrumental"]},"works":[{"id":214150565860181,"type":"album","name":"Ballasted Orchestra","artist":"Stars Of The Lid","year":1997,"weight":15,"yt":"RFIimQUIUps","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":1203,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":17350863471177,"name":"RYM Top — Experimental — Drone","rank":49,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":137629407618220,"name":"RYM Top — Ambient","rank":91,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":150848509715573,"name":"RYM Top — Experimental","rank":139,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":4}},{"id":65969926811106,"type":"album","name":"Avec Laudenum","artist":"Stars of the Lid","year":1999,"weight":9,"yt":"hdcuVdN9Qcw","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":173793889343323,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1999","rank":186,"scaruffi":null},{"id":17350863471177,"name":"RYM Top — Experimental — Drone","rank":70,"scaruffi":null},{"id":137629407618220,"name":"RYM Top — Ambient","rank":139,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":3}},{"id":64406386802220,"type":"album","name":"The Tired Sounds Of","artist":"Stars Of The Lid","year":2001,"weight":16